{"1":{"w":[{"c":"الٓمٓ","d":"alif-lam-meem","e":"Alif Lam Mim"}],"a":{"g":"Alif, Lam, Meem."}},"2":{"w":[{"c":"غُلِبَتِ","d":"ghulibati","e":"Have been defeated"},{"c":"الرُّومُ","d":"l-rūmu","e":"the Romans"}],"a":{"g":"The Byzantines have been defeated"}},"3":{"w":[{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"In"},{"c":"أَدْنَى","d":"adnā","e":"(the) nearest"},{"c":"الْأَرْضِ","d":"l-arḍi","e":"land"},{"c":"وَهُمْ","d":"wahum","e":"But they"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"after"},{"c":"بَعْدِ","d":"baʿdi","e":"after"},{"c":"غَلَبِهِمْ","d":"ghalabihim","e":"their defeat"},{"c":"سَيَغْلِبُونَ","d":"sayaghlibūna","e":"will overcome"}],"a":{"g":"In the nearest land. But they, after their defeat, will overcome."}},"4":{"w":[{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"Within"},{"c":"بِضْعِ","d":"biḍ'ʿi","e":"a few"},{"c":"سِنِينَ","d":"sinīna","e":"years"},{"c":"لِلَّهِ","d":"lillahi","e":"For Allah"},{"c":"الْأَمْرُ","d":"l-amru","e":"(is) the command"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"before"},{"c":"قَبْلُ","d":"qablu","e":"before"},{"c":"وَمِنْ","d":"wamin","e":"and after"},{"c":"بَعْدُ","d":"baʿdu","e":"and after"},{"c":"وَيَوْمَئِذٍ","d":"wayawma-idhin","e":"And that day"},{"c":"يَفْرَحُ","d":"yafraḥu","e":"will rejoice"},{"c":"الْمُؤْمِنُونَ","d":"l-mu'minūna","e":"the believers"}],"a":{"g":"Within three to nine years. To Allah belongs the command before and after. And that day the believers will rejoice"}},"5":{"w":[{"c":"بِنَصْرِ","d":"binaṣri","e":"With (the) help"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"(of) Allah"},{"c":"يَنْصُرُ","d":"yanṣuru","e":"He helps"},{"c":"مَنْ","d":"man","e":"whom"},{"c":"يَشَاءُ","d":"yashāu","e":"He wills"},{"c":"وَهُوَ","d":"wahuwa","e":"And He"},{"c":"الْعَزِيزُ","d":"l-ʿazīzu","e":"(is) the All-Mighty"},{"c":"الرَّحِيمُ","d":"l-raḥīmu","e":"the Most Merciful"}],"a":{"g":"In the victory of Allah. He gives victory to whom He wills, and He is the Exalted in Might, the Merciful."}},"6":{"w":[{"c":"وَعْدَ","d":"waʿda","e":"(It is the) Promise"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"(of) Allah"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"(Does) not"},{"c":"يُخْلِفُ","d":"yukh'lifu","e":"fail"},{"c":"اللَّهُ","d":"l-lahu","e":"Allah"},{"c":"وَعْدَهُ","d":"waʿdahu","e":"(in) His promise"},{"c":"وَلَكِنَّ","d":"walākinna","e":"but"},{"c":"أَكْثَرَ","d":"akthara","e":"most (of)"},{"c":"النَّاسِ","d":"l-nāsi","e":"[the] people"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"(do) not"},{"c":"يَعْلَمُونَ","d":"yaʿlamūna","e":"know"}],"a":{"g":"[It is] the promise of Allah. Allah does not fail in His promise, but most of the people do not know."}},"7":{"w":[{"c":"يَعْلَمُونَ","d":"yaʿlamūna","e":"They know"},{"c":"ظَاهِرًا","d":"ẓāhiran","e":"(the) apparent"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"of"},{"c":"الْحَيَوةِ","d":"l-ḥayati","e":"the life"},{"c":"الدُّنْيَا","d":"l-dun'yā","e":"(of) the world"},{"c":"وَهُمْ","d":"wahum","e":"but they"},{"c":"عَنِ","d":"ʿani","e":"about"},{"c":"الْءَاخِرَةِ","d":"l-ākhirati","e":"the Hereafter"},{"c":"هُمْ","d":"hum","e":"[they]"},{"c":"غَافِلُونَ","d":"ghāfilūna","e":"(are) heedless"}],"a":{"g":"They know what is apparent of the worldly life, but they, of the Hereafter, are unaware."}},"8":{"w":[{"c":"أَوَلَمْ","d":"awalam","e":"Do not"},{"c":"يَتَفَكَّرُوا","d":"yatafakkarū","e":"they ponder"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"within"},{"c":"أَنْفُسِهِمْ","d":"anfusihim","e":"themselves"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"Not"},{"c":"خَلَقَ","d":"khalaqa","e":"Allah (has) created"},{"c":"اللَّهُ","d":"l-lahu","e":"Allah (has) created"},{"c":"السَّمَاوَاتِ","d":"l-samāwāti","e":"the heavens"},{"c":"وَالْأَرْضَ","d":"wal-arḍa","e":"and the earth"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"and what"},{"c":"بَيْنَهُمَا","d":"baynahumā","e":"(is) between them"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"except"},{"c":"بِالْحَقِّ","d":"bil-ḥaqi","e":"in truth"},{"c":"وَأَجَلٍ","d":"wa-ajalin","e":"and (for) a term"},{"c":"مُسَمًّى","d":"musamman","e":"appointed"},{"c":"وَإِنَّ","d":"wa-inna","e":"And indeed"},{"c":"كَثِيرًا","d":"kathīran","e":"many"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"of"},{"c":"النَّاسِ","d":"l-nāsi","e":"the people"},{"c":"بِلِقَاءِ","d":"biliqāi","e":"in (the) meeting"},{"c":"رَبِّهِمْ","d":"rabbihim","e":"(with) their Lord"},{"c":"لَكَافِرُونَ","d":"lakāfirūna","e":"surely (are) disbelievers"}],"a":{"g":"Do they not contemplate within themselves? Allah has not created the heavens and the earth and what is between them except in truth and for a specified term. And indeed, many of the people, in [the matter of] the meeting with their Lord, are disbelievers."}},"9":{"w":[{"c":"أَوَلَمْ","d":"awalam","e":"Have not"},{"c":"يَسِيرُوا","d":"yasīrū","e":"they traveled"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"الْأَرْضِ","d":"l-arḍi","e":"the earth"},{"c":"فَيَنْظُرُوا","d":"fayanẓurū","e":"and observed"},{"c":"كَيْفَ","d":"kayfa","e":"how"},{"c":"كَانَ","d":"kāna","e":"was"},{"c":"عَاقِبَةُ","d":"ʿāqibatu","e":"(the) end"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"(of) those"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"before them"},{"c":"قَبْلِهِمْ","d":"qablihim","e":"before them"},{"c":"كَانُوا","d":"kānū","e":"They were"},{"c":"أَشَدَّ","d":"ashadda","e":"mightier"},{"c":"مِنْهُمْ","d":"min'hum","e":"to them"},{"c":"قُوَّةً","d":"quwwatan","e":"(in) strength"},{"c":"وَأَثَارُوا","d":"wa-athārū","e":"and they dug"},{"c":"الْأَرْضَ","d":"l-arḍa","e":"the earth"},{"c":"وَعَمَرُوهَا","d":"waʿamarūhā","e":"and built (on) it"},{"c":"أَكْثَرَ","d":"akthara","e":"more"},{"c":"مِمَّا","d":"mimmā","e":"than what"},{"c":"عَمَرُوهَا","d":"ʿamarūhā","e":"they have built (on) it"},{"c":"وَجَاءَتْهُمْ","d":"wajāathum","e":"And came (to) them"},{"c":"رُسُلُهُمْ","d":"rusuluhum","e":"their Messengers"},{"c":"بِالْبَيِّنَاتِ","d":"bil-bayināti","e":"with clear proofs"},{"c":"فَمَا","d":"famā","e":"So not"},{"c":"كَانَ","d":"kāna","e":"was"},{"c":"اللَّهُ","d":"l-lahu","e":"Allah"},{"c":"لِيَظْلِمَهُمْ","d":"liyaẓlimahum","e":"to wrong them"},{"c":"وَلَكِنْ","d":"walākin","e":"but"},{"c":"كَانُوا","d":"kānū","e":"they were"},{"c":"أَنْفُسَهُمْ","d":"anfusahum","e":"themselves"},{"c":"يَظْلِمُونَ","d":"yaẓlimūna","e":"(doing) wrong"}],"a":{"g":"Have they not traveled through the earth and observed how was the end of those before them? They were greater than them in power, and they plowed the earth and built it up more than they have built it up, and their messengers came to them with clear evidences. And Allah would not ever have wronged them, but they were wronging themselves."}},"10":{"w":[{"c":"ثُمَّ","d":"thumma","e":"Then"},{"c":"كَانَ","d":"kāna","e":"was"},{"c":"عَاقِبَةَ","d":"ʿāqibata","e":"(the) end"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"(of) those who"},{"c":"أَسَاءُوا","d":"asāū","e":"did evil"},{"c":"السُّوأَى","d":"l-sūā","e":"the evil"},{"c":"أَنْ","d":"an","e":"because"},{"c":"كَذَّبُوا","d":"kadhabū","e":"they denied"},{"c":"بِءَايَاتِ","d":"biāyāti","e":"(the) Signs"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"(of) Allah"},{"c":"وَكَانُوا","d":"wakānū","e":"and were"},{"c":"بِهَا","d":"bihā","e":"of them"},{"c":"يَسْتَهْزِءُونَ","d":"yastahziūna","e":"making mockery"}],"a":{"g":"Then the end of those who did evil was the worst [consequence] because they denied the signs of Allah and used to ridicule them."}},"11":{"w":[{"c":"اللَّهُ","d":"al-lahu","e":"Allah"},{"c":"يَبْدَؤُا","d":"yabda-u","e":"originates"},{"c":"الْخَلْقَ","d":"l-khalqa","e":"the creation"},{"c":"ثُمَّ","d":"thumma","e":"then"},{"c":"يُعِيدُهُ","d":"yuʿīduhu","e":"He repeats it"},{"c":"ثُمَّ","d":"thumma","e":"then"},{"c":"إِلَيْهِ","d":"ilayhi","e":"to Him"},{"c":"تُرْجَعُونَ","d":"tur'jaʿūna","e":"you will be returned"}],"a":{"g":"Allah begins creation; then He will repeat it; then to Him you will be returned."}},"12":{"w":[{"c":"وَيَوْمَ","d":"wayawma","e":"And (the) Day"},{"c":"تَقُومُ","d":"taqūmu","e":"will (be) established"},{"c":"السَّاعَةُ","d":"l-sāʿatu","e":"the Hour"},{"c":"يُبْلِسُ","d":"yub'lisu","e":"will (be in) despair"},{"c":"الْمُجْرِمُونَ","d":"l-muj'rimūna","e":"the criminals"}],"a":{"g":"And the Day the Hour appears the criminals will be in despair."}},"13":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَمْ","d":"walam","e":"And not"},{"c":"يَكُنْ","d":"yakun","e":"will be"},{"c":"لَهُمْ","d":"lahum","e":"for them"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"among"},{"c":"شُرَكَائِهِمْ","d":"shurakāihim","e":"theirs partners"},{"c":"شُفَعَؤُا","d":"shufaʿāu","e":"any intercessors"},{"c":"وَكَانُوا","d":"wakānū","e":"and they will be"},{"c":"بِشُرَكَائِهِمْ","d":"bishurakāihim","e":"in their partners"},{"c":"كَافِرِينَ","d":"kāfirīna","e":"disbelievers"}],"a":{"g":"And there will not be for them among their [alleged] partners any intercessors, and they will [then] be disbelievers in their partners."}},"14":{"w":[{"c":"وَيَوْمَ","d":"wayawma","e":"And (the) Day"},{"c":"تَقُومُ","d":"taqūmu","e":"will (be) established"},{"c":"السَّاعَةُ","d":"l-sāʿatu","e":"the Hour"},{"c":"يَوْمَئِذٍ","d":"yawma-idhin","e":"that Day"},{"c":"يَتَفَرَّقُونَ","d":"yatafarraqūna","e":"they will become separated"}],"a":{"g":"And the Day the Hour appears - that Day they will become separated."}},"15":{"w":[{"c":"فَأَمَّا","d":"fa-ammā","e":"Then as for"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"those who"},{"c":"ءَامَنُوا","d":"āmanū","e":"believed"},{"c":"وَعَمِلُوا","d":"waʿamilū","e":"and did"},{"c":"الصَّالِحَاتِ","d":"l-ṣāliḥāti","e":"righteous deeds"},{"c":"فَهُمْ","d":"fahum","e":"so they"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"رَوْضَةٍ","d":"rawḍatin","e":"a Garden"},{"c":"يُحْبَرُونَ","d":"yuḥ'barūna","e":"will be delighted"}],"a":{"g":"And as for those who had believed and done righteous deeds, they will be in a garden [of Paradise], delighted."}},"16":{"w":[{"c":"وَأَمَّا","d":"wa-ammā","e":"But as for"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"those who"},{"c":"كَفَرُوا","d":"kafarū","e":"disbelieved"},{"c":"وَكَذَّبُوا","d":"wakadhabū","e":"and denied"},{"c":"بِءَايَاتِنَا","d":"biāyātinā","e":"Our Signs"},{"c":"وَلِقَاءِ","d":"waliqāi","e":"and (the) meeting"},{"c":"الْءَاخِرَةِ","d":"l-ākhirati","e":"(of) the Hereafter"},{"c":"فَأُولَئِكَ","d":"fa-ulāika","e":"then those"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"الْعَذَابِ","d":"l-ʿadhābi","e":"the punishment"},{"c":"مُحْضَرُونَ","d":"muḥ'ḍarūna","e":"(will be) brought forth"}],"a":{"g":"But as for those who disbelieved and denied Our verses and the meeting of the Hereafter, those will be brought into the punishment [to remain]."}},"17":{"w":[{"c":"فَسُبْحَانَ","d":"fasub'ḥāna","e":"So glory be to"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"Allah"},{"c":"حِينَ","d":"ḥīna","e":"when"},{"c":"تُمْسُونَ","d":"tum'sūna","e":"you reach the evening"},{"c":"وَحِينَ","d":"waḥīna","e":"and when"},{"c":"تُصْبِحُونَ","d":"tuṣ'biḥūna","e":"you reach the morning"}],"a":{"g":"So exalted is Allah when you reach the evening and when you reach the morning."}},"18":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَهُ","d":"walahu","e":"And for Him"},{"c":"الْحَمْدُ","d":"l-ḥamdu","e":"(are) all praises"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"السَّمَاوَاتِ","d":"l-samāwāti","e":"the heavens"},{"c":"وَالْأَرْضِ","d":"wal-arḍi","e":"and the earth"},{"c":"وَعَشِيًّا","d":"waʿashiyyan","e":"and (at) night"},{"c":"وَحِينَ","d":"waḥīna","e":"and when"},{"c":"تُظْهِرُونَ","d":"tuẓ'hirūna","e":"you are at noon"}],"a":{"g":"And to Him is [due all] praise throughout the heavens and the earth. And [exalted is He] at night and when you are at noon."}},"19":{"w":[{"c":"يُخْرِجُ","d":"yukh'riju","e":"He brings forth"},{"c":"الْحَيَّ","d":"l-ḥaya","e":"the living"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"from"},{"c":"الْمَيِّتِ","d":"l-mayiti","e":"the dead"},{"c":"وَيُخْرِجُ","d":"wayukh'riju","e":"and He brings forth"},{"c":"الْمَيِّتَ","d":"l-mayita","e":"the dead"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"from"},{"c":"الْحَيِّ","d":"l-ḥayi","e":"the living"},{"c":"وَيُحْيِي","d":"wayuḥ'yī","e":"and He gives life"},{"c":"الْأَرْضَ","d":"l-arḍa","e":"(to) the earth"},{"c":"بَعْدَ","d":"baʿda","e":"after"},{"c":"مَوْتِهَا","d":"mawtihā","e":"its death"},{"c":"وَكَذَلِكَ","d":"wakadhālika","e":"and thus"},{"c":"تُخْرَجُونَ","d":"tukh'rajūna","e":"you will be brought forth"}],"a":{"g":"He brings the living out of the dead and brings the dead out of the living and brings to life the earth after its lifelessness. And thus will you be brought out."}},"20":{"w":[{"c":"وَمِنْ","d":"wamin","e":"And among"},{"c":"ءَايَاتِهِ","d":"āyātihi","e":"His Signs"},{"c":"أَنْ","d":"an","e":"(is) that"},{"c":"خَلَقَكُمْ","d":"khalaqakum","e":"He created you"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"تُرَابٍ","d":"turābin","e":"dust"},{"c":"ثُمَّ","d":"thumma","e":"then"},{"c":"إِذَا","d":"idhā","e":"behold!"},{"c":"أَنْتُمْ","d":"antum","e":"You"},{"c":"بَشَرٌ","d":"basharun","e":"(are) human beings"},{"c":"تَنْتَشِرُونَ","d":"tantashirūna","e":"dispersing"}],"a":{"g":"And of His signs is that He created you from dust; then, suddenly you were human beings dispersing [throughout the earth]."}},"21":{"w":[{"c":"وَمِنْ","d":"wamin","e":"And among"},{"c":"ءَايَاتِهِ","d":"āyātihi","e":"His Signs"},{"c":"أَنْ","d":"an","e":"(is) that"},{"c":"خَلَقَ","d":"khalaqa","e":"He created"},{"c":"لَكُمْ","d":"lakum","e":"for you"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"أَنْفُسِكُمْ","d":"anfusikum","e":"yourselves"},{"c":"أَزْوَاجًا","d":"azwājan","e":"mates"},{"c":"لِتَسْكُنُوا","d":"litaskunū","e":"that you may find tranquility"},{"c":"إِلَيْهَا","d":"ilayhā","e":"in them"},{"c":"وَجَعَلَ","d":"wajaʿala","e":"and He placed"},{"c":"بَيْنَكُمْ","d":"baynakum","e":"between you"},{"c":"مَوَدَّةً","d":"mawaddatan","e":"love"},{"c":"وَرَحْمَةً","d":"waraḥmatan","e":"and mercy"},{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"ذَلِكَ","d":"dhālika","e":"that"},{"c":"لَءَايَاتٍ","d":"laāyātin","e":"surely (are) Signs"},{"c":"لِقَوْمٍ","d":"liqawmin","e":"for a people"},{"c":"يَتَفَكَّرُونَ","d":"yatafakkarūna","e":"who reflect"}],"a":{"g":"And of His signs is that He created for you from yourselves mates that you may find tranquillity in them; and He placed between you affection and mercy. Indeed in that are signs for a people who give thought."}},"22":{"w":[{"c":"وَمِنْ","d":"wamin","e":"And among"},{"c":"ءَايَاتِهِ","d":"āyātihi","e":"His Signs"},{"c":"خَلْقُ","d":"khalqu","e":"(is the) creation"},{"c":"السَّمَاوَاتِ","d":"l-samāwāti","e":"(of) the heavens"},{"c":"وَالْأَرْضِ","d":"wal-arḍi","e":"and the earth"},{"c":"وَاخْتِلَافُ","d":"wa-ikh'tilāfu","e":"and the diversity"},{"c":"أَلْسِنَتِكُمْ","d":"alsinatikum","e":"(of) your languages"},{"c":"وَأَلْوَانِكُمْ","d":"wa-alwānikum","e":"and your colors"},{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"ذَلِكَ","d":"dhālika","e":"that"},{"c":"لَءَايَاتٍ","d":"laāyātin","e":"surely (are) Signs"},{"c":"لِلْعَالِمِينَ","d":"lil'ʿālimīna","e":"for those of knowledge"}],"a":{"g":"And of His signs is the creation of the heavens and the earth and the diversity of your languages and your colors. Indeed in that are signs for those of knowledge."}},"23":{"w":[{"c":"وَمِنْ","d":"wamin","e":"And among"},{"c":"ءَايَاتِهِ","d":"āyātihi","e":"His Signs"},{"c":"مَنَامُكُمْ","d":"manāmukum","e":"(is) your sleep"},{"c":"بِاللَّيْلِ","d":"bi-al-layli","e":"by night"},{"c":"وَالنَّهَارِ","d":"wal-nahāri","e":"and the day"},{"c":"وَابْتِغَاؤُكُمْ","d":"wa-ib'tighāukum","e":"[and] your seeking"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"of"},{"c":"فَضْلِهِ","d":"faḍlihi","e":"His Bounty"},{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"ذَلِكَ","d":"dhālika","e":"that"},{"c":"لَءَايَاتٍ","d":"laāyātin","e":"surely (are) Signs"},{"c":"لِقَوْمٍ","d":"liqawmin","e":"for a people"},{"c":"يَسْمَعُونَ","d":"yasmaʿūna","e":"who listen"}],"a":{"g":"And of His signs is your sleep by night and day and your seeking of His bounty. Indeed in that are signs for a people who listen."}},"24":{"w":[{"c":"وَمِنْ","d":"wamin","e":"And among"},{"c":"ءَايَاتِهِ","d":"āyātihi","e":"His Signs"},{"c":"يُرِيكُمُ","d":"yurīkumu","e":"He shows you"},{"c":"الْبَرْقَ","d":"l-barqa","e":"the lightning"},{"c":"خَوْفًا","d":"khawfan","e":"(causing) fear"},{"c":"وَطَمَعًا","d":"waṭamaʿan","e":"and hope"},{"c":"وَيُنَزِّلُ","d":"wayunazzilu","e":"and He sends down"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"from"},{"c":"السَّمَاءِ","d":"l-samāi","e":"the sky"},{"c":"مَاءً","d":"māan","e":"water"},{"c":"فَيُحْيِي","d":"fayuḥ'yī","e":"and gives life"},{"c":"بِهِ","d":"bihi","e":"therewith"},{"c":"الْأَرْضَ","d":"l-arḍa","e":"(to) the earth"},{"c":"بَعْدَ","d":"baʿda","e":"after"},{"c":"مَوْتِهَا","d":"mawtihā","e":"its death"},{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"ذَلِكَ","d":"dhālika","e":"that"},{"c":"لَءَايَاتٍ","d":"laāyātin","e":"surely (are) Signs"},{"c":"لِقَوْمٍ","d":"liqawmin","e":"for a people"},{"c":"يَعْقِلُونَ","d":"yaʿqilūna","e":"who use intellect"}],"a":{"g":"And of His signs is [that] He shows you the lightning [causing] fear and aspiration, and He sends down rain from the sky by which He brings to life the earth after its lifelessness. Indeed in that are signs for a people who use reason."}},"25":{"w":[{"c":"وَمِنْ","d":"wamin","e":"And among"},{"c":"ءَايَاتِهِ","d":"āyātihi","e":"His Signs"},{"c":"أَنْ","d":"an","e":"(is) that"},{"c":"تَقُومَ","d":"taqūma","e":"stands"},{"c":"السَّمَاءُ","d":"l-samāu","e":"the heavens"},{"c":"وَالْأَرْضُ","d":"wal-arḍu","e":"and the earth"},{"c":"بِأَمْرِهِ","d":"bi-amrihi","e":"by His Command"},{"c":"ثُمَّ","d":"thumma","e":"Then"},{"c":"إِذَا","d":"idhā","e":"when"},{"c":"دَعَاكُمْ","d":"daʿākum","e":"He calls you"},{"c":"دَعْوَةً","d":"daʿwatan","e":"(with) a call"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"from"},{"c":"الْأَرْضِ","d":"l-arḍi","e":"the earth"},{"c":"إِذَا","d":"idhā","e":"behold!"},{"c":"أَنْتُمْ","d":"antum","e":"You"},{"c":"تَخْرُجُونَ","d":"takhrujūna","e":"will come forth"}],"a":{"g":"And of His signs is that the heaven and earth remain by His command. Then when He calls you with a [single] call from the earth, immediately you will come forth."}},"26":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَهُ","d":"walahu","e":"And to Him (belongs)"},{"c":"مَنْ","d":"man","e":"whoever"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"(is) in"},{"c":"السَّمَاوَاتِ","d":"l-samāwāti","e":"the heavens"},{"c":"وَالْأَرْضِ","d":"wal-arḍi","e":"and the earth"},{"c":"كُلٌّ","d":"kullun","e":"All"},{"c":"لَهُ","d":"lahu","e":"to Him"},{"c":"قَانِتُونَ","d":"qānitūna","e":"(are) obedient"}],"a":{"g":"And to Him belongs whoever is in the heavens and earth. All are to Him devoutly obedient."}},"27":{"w":[{"c":"وَهُوَ","d":"wahuwa","e":"And He"},{"c":"الَّذِي","d":"alladhī","e":"(is) the One Who"},{"c":"يَبْدَؤُا","d":"yabda-u","e":"originates"},{"c":"الْخَلْقَ","d":"l-khalqa","e":"the creation"},{"c":"ثُمَّ","d":"thumma","e":"then"},{"c":"يُعِيدُهُ","d":"yuʿīduhu","e":"repeats it"},{"c":"وَهُوَ","d":"wahuwa","e":"and it"},{"c":"أَهْوَنُ","d":"ahwanu","e":"(is) easier"},{"c":"عَلَيْهِ","d":"ʿalayhi","e":"for Him"},{"c":"وَلَهُ","d":"walahu","e":"And for Him"},{"c":"الْمَثَلُ","d":"l-mathalu","e":"(is) the description"},{"c":"الْأَعْلَى","d":"l-aʿlā","e":"the highest"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"السَّمَاوَاتِ","d":"l-samāwāti","e":"the heavens"},{"c":"وَالْأَرْضِ","d":"wal-arḍi","e":"and the earth"},{"c":"وَهُوَ","d":"wahuwa","e":"And He"},{"c":"الْعَزِيزُ","d":"l-ʿazīzu","e":"(is) the All-Mighty"},{"c":"الْحَكِيمُ","d":"l-ḥakīmu","e":"the All-Wise"}],"a":{"g":"And it is He who begins creation; then He repeats it, and that is [even] easier for Him. To Him belongs the highest attribute in the heavens and earth. And He is the Exalted in Might, the Wise."}},"28":{"w":[{"c":"ضَرَبَ","d":"ḍaraba","e":"He sets forth"},{"c":"لَكُمْ","d":"lakum","e":"to you"},{"c":"مَثَلًا","d":"mathalan","e":"an example"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"أَنْفُسِكُمْ","d":"anfusikum","e":"yourselves"},{"c":"هَلْ","d":"hal","e":"Is"},{"c":"لَكُمْ","d":"lakum","e":"for you"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"among"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"what"},{"c":"مَلَكَتْ","d":"malakat","e":"posses"},{"c":"أَيْمَانُكُمْ","d":"aymānukum","e":"your right hands"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"any"},{"c":"شُرَكَاءَ","d":"shurakāa","e":"partners"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"what"},{"c":"رَزَقْنَاكُمْ","d":"razaqnākum","e":"We have provided you"},{"c":"فَأَنْتُمْ","d":"fa-antum","e":"so you"},{"c":"فِيهِ","d":"fīhi","e":"in it"},{"c":"سَوَاءٌ","d":"sawāon","e":"(are) equal"},{"c":"تَخَافُونَهُمْ","d":"takhāfūnahum","e":"you fear them"},{"c":"كَخِيفَتِكُمْ","d":"kakhīfatikum","e":"as you fear"},{"c":"أَنْفُسَكُمْ","d":"anfusakum","e":"yourselves"},{"c":"كَذَلِكَ","d":"kadhālika","e":"Thus"},{"c":"نُفَصِّلُ","d":"nufaṣṣilu","e":"We explain"},{"c":"الْءَايَاتِ","d":"l-āyāti","e":"the Verses"},{"c":"لِقَوْمٍ","d":"liqawmin","e":"for a people"},{"c":"يَعْقِلُونَ","d":"yaʿqilūna","e":"(who) use reason"}],"a":{"g":"He presents to you an example from yourselves. Do you have among those whom your right hands possess any partners in what We have provided for you so that you are equal therein [and] would fear them as your fear of one another [within a partnership]? Thus do We detail the verses for a people who use reason."}},"29":{"w":[{"c":"بَلِ","d":"bali","e":"Nay"},{"c":"اتَّبَعَ","d":"ittabaʿa","e":"follow"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"those who"},{"c":"ظَلَمُوا","d":"ẓalamū","e":"do wrong"},{"c":"أَهْوَاءَهُمْ","d":"ahwāahum","e":"their desires"},{"c":"بِغَيْرِ","d":"bighayri","e":"without"},{"c":"عِلْمٍ","d":"ʿil'min","e":"knowledge"},{"c":"فَمَنْ","d":"faman","e":"Then who"},{"c":"يَهْدِي","d":"yahdī","e":"(can) guide"},{"c":"مَنْ","d":"man","e":"(one) whom"},{"c":"أَضَلَّ","d":"aḍalla","e":"Allah has let go astray"},{"c":"اللَّهُ","d":"l-lahu","e":"Allah has let go astray"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"And not"},{"c":"لَهُمْ","d":"lahum","e":"for them"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"any"},{"c":"نَاصِرِينَ","d":"nāṣirīna","e":"helpers"}],"a":{"g":"But those who wrong follow their [own] desires without knowledge. Then who can guide one whom Allah has sent astray? And for them there are no helpers."}},"30":{"w":[{"c":"فَأَقِمْ","d":"fa-aqim","e":"So set"},{"c":"وَجْهَكَ","d":"wajhaka","e":"your face"},{"c":"لِلدِّينِ","d":"lilddīni","e":"to the religion"},{"c":"حَنِيفًا","d":"ḥanīfan","e":"upright"},{"c":"فِطْرَتَ","d":"fiṭ'rata","e":"Nature"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"(made by) Allah"},{"c":"الَّتِي","d":"allatī","e":"(upon) which"},{"c":"فَطَرَ","d":"faṭara","e":"He has created"},{"c":"النَّاسَ","d":"l-nāsa","e":"mankind"},{"c":"عَلَيْهَا","d":"ʿalayhā","e":"[on it]"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"No"},{"c":"تَبْدِيلَ","d":"tabdīla","e":"change"},{"c":"لِخَلْقِ","d":"likhalqi","e":"(should there be) in the creation"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"(of) Allah"},{"c":"ذَلِكَ","d":"dhālika","e":"That"},{"c":"الدِّينُ","d":"l-dīnu","e":"(is) the religion"},{"c":"الْقَيِّمُ","d":"l-qayimu","e":"the correct"},{"c":"وَلَكِنَّ","d":"walākinna","e":"but"},{"c":"أَكْثَرَ","d":"akthara","e":"most"},{"c":"النَّاسِ","d":"l-nāsi","e":"men"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"(do) not"},{"c":"يَعْلَمُونَ","d":"yaʿlamūna","e":"know"}],"a":{"g":"So direct your face toward the religion, inclining to truth. [Adhere to] the fitrah of Allah upon which He has created [all] people. No change should there be in the creation of Allah. That is the correct religion, but most of the people do not know."}},"31":{"w":[{"c":"مُنِيبِينَ","d":"munībīna","e":"Turning"},{"c":"إِلَيْهِ","d":"ilayhi","e":"to Him"},{"c":"وَاتَّقُوهُ","d":"wa-ittaqūhu","e":"and fear Him"},{"c":"وَأَقِيمُوا","d":"wa-aqīmū","e":"and establish"},{"c":"الصَّلَوةَ","d":"l-ṣalata","e":"the prayer"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"and (do) not"},{"c":"تَكُونُوا","d":"takūnū","e":"be"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"of"},{"c":"الْمُشْرِكِينَ","d":"l-mush'rikīna","e":"the polytheists"}],"a":{"g":"[Adhere to it], turning in repentance to Him, and fear Him and establish prayer and do not be of those who associate others with Allah"}},"32":{"w":[{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"Of"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"those who"},{"c":"فَرَّقُوا","d":"farraqū","e":"divide"},{"c":"دِينَهُمْ","d":"dīnahum","e":"their religion"},{"c":"وَكَانُوا","d":"wakānū","e":"and become"},{"c":"شِيَعًا","d":"shiyaʿan","e":"sects"},{"c":"كُلُّ","d":"kullu","e":"each"},{"c":"حِزْبٍ","d":"ḥiz'bin","e":"party"},{"c":"بِمَا","d":"bimā","e":"in what"},{"c":"لَدَيْهِمْ","d":"ladayhim","e":"they have"},{"c":"فَرِحُونَ","d":"fariḥūna","e":"rejoicing"}],"a":{"g":"[Or] of those who have divided their religion and become sects, every faction rejoicing in what it has."}},"33":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِذَا","d":"wa-idhā","e":"And when"},{"c":"مَسَّ","d":"massa","e":"touches"},{"c":"النَّاسَ","d":"l-nāsa","e":"men"},{"c":"ضُرٌّ","d":"ḍurrun","e":"hardship"},{"c":"دَعَوْا","d":"daʿaw","e":"they call"},{"c":"رَبَّهُمْ","d":"rabbahum","e":"their Lord"},{"c":"مُنِيبِينَ","d":"munībīna","e":"turning"},{"c":"إِلَيْهِ","d":"ilayhi","e":"to Him"},{"c":"ثُمَّ","d":"thumma","e":"Then"},{"c":"إِذَا","d":"idhā","e":"when"},{"c":"أَذَاقَهُمْ","d":"adhāqahum","e":"He causes them to taste"},{"c":"مِنْهُ","d":"min'hu","e":"from Him"},{"c":"رَحْمَةً","d":"raḥmatan","e":"Mercy"},{"c":"إِذَا","d":"idhā","e":"behold!"},{"c":"فَرِيقٌ","d":"farīqun","e":"A party"},{"c":"مِنْهُمْ","d":"min'hum","e":"of them"},{"c":"بِرَبِّهِمْ","d":"birabbihim","e":"with their Lord"},{"c":"يُشْرِكُونَ","d":"yush'rikūna","e":"associate partners"}],"a":{"g":"And when adversity touches the people, they call upon their Lord, turning in repentance to Him. Then when He lets them taste mercy from Him, at once a party of them associate others with their Lord,"}},"34":{"w":[{"c":"لِيَكْفُرُوا","d":"liyakfurū","e":"So as to deny"},{"c":"بِمَا","d":"bimā","e":"[in] what"},{"c":"ءَاتَيْنَاهُمْ","d":"ātaynāhum","e":"We have granted them"},{"c":"فَتَمَتَّعُوا","d":"fatamattaʿū","e":"Then enjoy"},{"c":"فَسَوْفَ","d":"fasawfa","e":"but soon"},{"c":"تَعْلَمُونَ","d":"taʿlamūna","e":"you will know"}],"a":{"g":"So that they will deny what We have granted them. Then enjoy yourselves, for you are going to know."}},"35":{"w":[{"c":"أَمْ","d":"am","e":"Or"},{"c":"أَنْزَلْنَا","d":"anzalnā","e":"have We sent"},{"c":"عَلَيْهِمْ","d":"ʿalayhim","e":"to them"},{"c":"سُلْطَانًا","d":"sul'ṭānan","e":"an authority"},{"c":"فَهُوَ","d":"fahuwa","e":"and it"},{"c":"يَتَكَلَّمُ","d":"yatakallamu","e":"speaks"},{"c":"بِمَا","d":"bimā","e":"of what"},{"c":"كَانُوا","d":"kānū","e":"they were"},{"c":"بِهِ","d":"bihi","e":"with Him"},{"c":"يُشْرِكُونَ","d":"yush'rikūna","e":"associating"}],"a":{"g":"Or have We sent down to them an authority, and it speaks of what they were associating with Him?"}},"36":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِذَا","d":"wa-idhā","e":"And when"},{"c":"أَذَقْنَا","d":"adhaqnā","e":"We cause men to taste"},{"c":"النَّاسَ","d":"l-nāsa","e":"We cause men to taste"},{"c":"رَحْمَةً","d":"raḥmatan","e":"mercy"},{"c":"فَرِحُوا","d":"fariḥū","e":"they rejoice"},{"c":"بِهَا","d":"bihā","e":"therein"},{"c":"وَإِنْ","d":"wa-in","e":"But if"},{"c":"تُصِبْهُمْ","d":"tuṣib'hum","e":"afflicts them"},{"c":"سَيِّئَةٌ","d":"sayyi-atun","e":"an evil"},{"c":"بِمَا","d":"bimā","e":"for what"},{"c":"قَدَّمَتْ","d":"qaddamat","e":"have sent forth"},{"c":"أَيْدِيهِمْ","d":"aydīhim","e":"their hands"},{"c":"إِذَا","d":"idhā","e":"behold"},{"c":"هُمْ","d":"hum","e":"They"},{"c":"يَقْنَطُونَ","d":"yaqnaṭūna","e":"despair"}],"a":{"g":"And when We let the people taste mercy, they rejoice therein, but if evil afflicts them for what their hands have put forth, immediately they despair."}},"37":{"w":[{"c":"أَوَلَمْ","d":"awalam","e":"Do not"},{"c":"يَرَوْا","d":"yaraw","e":"they see"},{"c":"أَنَّ","d":"anna","e":"that"},{"c":"اللَّهَ","d":"l-laha","e":"Allah"},{"c":"يَبْسُطُ","d":"yabsuṭu","e":"extends"},{"c":"الرِّزْقَ","d":"l-riz'qa","e":"the provision"},{"c":"لِمَنْ","d":"liman","e":"for whom"},{"c":"يَشَاءُ","d":"yashāu","e":"He wills"},{"c":"وَيَقْدِرُ","d":"wayaqdiru","e":"and straitens (it)"},{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"ذَلِكَ","d":"dhālika","e":"that"},{"c":"لَءَايَاتٍ","d":"laāyātin","e":"surely (are) Signs"},{"c":"لِقَوْمٍ","d":"liqawmin","e":"for a people"},{"c":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","d":"yu'minūna","e":"who believe"}],"a":{"g":"Do they not see that Allah extends provision for whom He wills and restricts [it]? Indeed, in that are signs for a people who believe."}},"38":{"w":[{"c":"فَءَاتِ","d":"faāti","e":"So give"},{"c":"ذَا","d":"dhā","e":"the relative"},{"c":"الْقُرْبَى","d":"l-qur'bā","e":"the relative"},{"c":"حَقَّهُ","d":"ḥaqqahu","e":"his right"},{"c":"وَالْمِسْكِينَ","d":"wal-mis'kīna","e":"and the poor"},{"c":"وَابْنَ","d":"wa-ib'na","e":"and the wayfarer"},{"c":"السَّبِيلِ","d":"l-sabīli","e":"and the wayfarer"},{"c":"ذَلِكَ","d":"dhālika","e":"That"},{"c":"خَيْرٌ","d":"khayrun","e":"(is) best"},{"c":"لِلَّذِينَ","d":"lilladhīna","e":"for those who"},{"c":"يُرِيدُونَ","d":"yurīdūna","e":"desire"},{"c":"وَجْهَ","d":"wajha","e":"(the) Countenance"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"(of) Allah"},{"c":"وَأُولَئِكَ","d":"wa-ulāika","e":"And those"},{"c":"هُمُ","d":"humu","e":"they"},{"c":"الْمُفْلِحُونَ","d":"l-muf'liḥūna","e":"(are) the successful ones"}],"a":{"g":"So give the relative his right, as well as the needy and the traveler. That is best for those who desire the countenance of Allah, and it is they who will be the successful."}},"39":{"w":[{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"And what"},{"c":"ءَاتَيْتُمْ","d":"ātaytum","e":"you give"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"for"},{"c":"رِبًا","d":"riban","e":"usury"},{"c":"لِيَرْبُوَا","d":"liyarbuwā","e":"to increase"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"أَمْوَالِ","d":"amwāli","e":"(the) wealth"},{"c":"النَّاسِ","d":"l-nāsi","e":"(of) people"},{"c":"فَلَا","d":"falā","e":"not"},{"c":"يَرْبُوا","d":"yarbū","e":"(will) increase"},{"c":"عِنْدَ","d":"ʿinda","e":"with"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"Allah"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"But what"},{"c":"ءَاتَيْتُمْ","d":"ātaytum","e":"you give"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"of"},{"c":"زَكَوةٍ","d":"zakatin","e":"zakah"},{"c":"تُرِيدُونَ","d":"turīdūna","e":"desiring"},{"c":"وَجْهَ","d":"wajha","e":"(the) Countenance"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"(of) Allah"},{"c":"فَأُولَئِكَ","d":"fa-ulāika","e":"then those"},{"c":"هُمُ","d":"humu","e":"[they]"},{"c":"الْمُضْعِفُونَ","d":"l-muḍ'ʿifūna","e":"(will) get manifold"}],"a":{"g":"And whatever you give for interest to increase within the wealth of people will not increase with Allah. But what you give in zakah, desiring the countenance of Allah - those are the multipliers."}},"40":{"w":[{"c":"اللَّهُ","d":"al-lahu","e":"Allah"},{"c":"الَّذِي","d":"alladhī","e":"(is) the One Who"},{"c":"خَلَقَكُمْ","d":"khalaqakum","e":"created you"},{"c":"ثُمَّ","d":"thumma","e":"then"},{"c":"رَزَقَكُمْ","d":"razaqakum","e":"He provided (for) you"},{"c":"ثُمَّ","d":"thumma","e":"then"},{"c":"يُمِيتُكُمْ","d":"yumītukum","e":"He will cause you to die"},{"c":"ثُمَّ","d":"thumma","e":"then"},{"c":"يُحْيِيكُمْ","d":"yuḥ'yīkum","e":"He will give you life"},{"c":"هَلْ","d":"hal","e":"Is (there)"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"any"},{"c":"شُرَكَائِكُمْ","d":"shurakāikum","e":"(of) your partners"},{"c":"مَنْ","d":"man","e":"who"},{"c":"يَفْعَلُ","d":"yafʿalu","e":"does"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"of"},{"c":"ذَلِكُمْ","d":"dhālikum","e":"that"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"any"},{"c":"شَيْءٍ","d":"shayin","e":"thing"},{"c":"سُبْحَانَهُ","d":"sub'ḥānahu","e":"Glory be to Him"},{"c":"وَتَعَالَى","d":"wataʿālā","e":"and exalted is He"},{"c":"عَمَّا","d":"ʿammā","e":"above what"},{"c":"يُشْرِكُونَ","d":"yush'rikūna","e":"they associate"}],"a":{"g":"Allah is the one who created you, then provided for you, then will cause you to die, and then will give you life. Are there any of your \"partners\" who does anything of that? Exalted is He and high above what they associate with Him."}},"41":{"w":[{"c":"ظَهَرَ","d":"ẓahara","e":"Has appeared"},{"c":"الْفَسَادُ","d":"l-fasādu","e":"the corruption"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"الْبَرِّ","d":"l-bari","e":"the land"},{"c":"وَالْبَحْرِ","d":"wal-baḥri","e":"and the sea"},{"c":"بِمَا","d":"bimā","e":"for what"},{"c":"كَسَبَتْ","d":"kasabat","e":"have earned"},{"c":"أَيْدِي","d":"aydī","e":"(the) hands"},{"c":"النَّاسِ","d":"l-nāsi","e":"(of) people"},{"c":"لِيُذِيقَهُمْ","d":"liyudhīqahum","e":"so that He may let them taste"},{"c":"بَعْضَ","d":"baʿḍa","e":"a part"},{"c":"الَّذِي","d":"alladhī","e":"(of) that which"},{"c":"عَمِلُوا","d":"ʿamilū","e":"they have done"},{"c":"لَعَلَّهُمْ","d":"laʿallahum","e":"so that they may"},{"c":"يَرْجِعُونَ","d":"yarjiʿūna","e":"return"}],"a":{"g":"Corruption has appeared throughout the land and sea by [reason of] what the hands of people have earned so He may let them taste part of [the consequence of] what they have done that perhaps they will return [to righteousness]."}},"42":{"w":[{"c":"قُلْ","d":"qul","e":"Say"},{"c":"سِيرُوا","d":"sīrū","e":"Travel"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"الْأَرْضِ","d":"l-arḍi","e":"the earth"},{"c":"فَانْظُرُوا","d":"fa-unẓurū","e":"and see"},{"c":"كَيْفَ","d":"kayfa","e":"how"},{"c":"كَانَ","d":"kāna","e":"was"},{"c":"عَاقِبَةُ","d":"ʿāqibatu","e":"(the) end"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"(of) those who"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"(were) before"},{"c":"قَبْلُ","d":"qablu","e":"(were) before"},{"c":"كَانَ","d":"kāna","e":"Most of them were"},{"c":"أَكْثَرُهُمْ","d":"aktharuhum","e":"Most of them were"},{"c":"مُشْرِكِينَ","d":"mush'rikīna","e":"polytheists"}],"a":{"g":"Say, [O Muhammad], \"Travel through the land and observe how was the end of those before. Most of them were associators [of others with Allah]."}},"43":{"w":[{"c":"فَأَقِمْ","d":"fa-aqim","e":"So set"},{"c":"وَجْهَكَ","d":"wajhaka","e":"your face"},{"c":"لِلدِّينِ","d":"lilddīni","e":"to the religion"},{"c":"الْقَيِّمِ","d":"l-qayimi","e":"right"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"before"},{"c":"قَبْلِ","d":"qabli","e":"before"},{"c":"أَنْ","d":"an","e":"[that]"},{"c":"يَأْتِيَ","d":"yatiya","e":"comes"},{"c":"يَوْمٌ","d":"yawmun","e":"a Day"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"not"},{"c":"مَرَدَّ","d":"maradda","e":"(can be) averted"},{"c":"لَهُ","d":"lahu","e":"[it]"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"from"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"Allah"},{"c":"يَوْمَئِذٍ","d":"yawma-idhin","e":"That Day"},{"c":"يَصَّدَّعُونَ","d":"yaṣṣaddaʿūna","e":"they will be divided"}],"a":{"g":"So direct your face toward the correct religion before a Day comes from Allah of which there is no repelling. That Day, they will be divided."}},"44":{"w":[{"c":"مَنْ","d":"man","e":"Whoever"},{"c":"كَفَرَ","d":"kafara","e":"disbelieves"},{"c":"فَعَلَيْهِ","d":"faʿalayhi","e":"then against him"},{"c":"كُفْرُهُ","d":"kuf'ruhu","e":"(is) his disbelief"},{"c":"وَمَنْ","d":"waman","e":"And whoever"},{"c":"عَمِلَ","d":"ʿamila","e":"does"},{"c":"صَالِحًا","d":"ṣāliḥan","e":"righteousness"},{"c":"فَلِأَنْفُسِهِمْ","d":"fali-anfusihim","e":"then for themselves"},{"c":"يَمْهَدُونَ","d":"yamhadūna","e":"they are preparing"}],"a":{"g":"Whoever disbelieves - upon him is [the consequence of] his disbelief. And whoever does righteousness - they are for themselves preparing,"}},"45":{"w":[{"c":"لِيَجْزِيَ","d":"liyajziya","e":"That He may reward"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"those who"},{"c":"ءَامَنُوا","d":"āmanū","e":"believe"},{"c":"وَعَمِلُوا","d":"waʿamilū","e":"and do"},{"c":"الصَّالِحَاتِ","d":"l-ṣāliḥāti","e":"righteous deeds"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"(out) of"},{"c":"فَضْلِهِ","d":"faḍlihi","e":"His Bounty"},{"c":"إِنَّهُ","d":"innahu","e":"Indeed He"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"(does) not"},{"c":"يُحِبُّ","d":"yuḥibbu","e":"like"},{"c":"الْكَافِرِينَ","d":"l-kāfirīna","e":"the disbelievers"}],"a":{"g":"That He may reward those who have believed and done righteous deeds out of His bounty. Indeed, He does not like the disbelievers."}},"46":{"w":[{"c":"وَمِنْ","d":"wamin","e":"And among"},{"c":"ءَايَاتِهِ","d":"āyātihi","e":"His Signs"},{"c":"أَنْ","d":"an","e":"(is) that"},{"c":"يُرْسِلَ","d":"yur'sila","e":"He sends"},{"c":"الرِّيَاحَ","d":"l-riyāḥa","e":"the winds"},{"c":"مُبَشِّرَاتٍ","d":"mubashirātin","e":"(as) bearers of glad tidings"},{"c":"وَلِيُذِيقَكُمْ","d":"waliyudhīqakum","e":"and to let you taste"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"of"},{"c":"رَحْمَتِهِ","d":"raḥmatihi","e":"His Mercy"},{"c":"وَلِتَجْرِيَ","d":"walitajriya","e":"and that may sail"},{"c":"الْفُلْكُ","d":"l-ful'ku","e":"the ships"},{"c":"بِأَمْرِهِ","d":"bi-amrihi","e":"at His Command"},{"c":"وَلِتَبْتَغُوا","d":"walitabtaghū","e":"and that you may seek"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"of"},{"c":"فَضْلِهِ","d":"faḍlihi","e":"His Bounty"},{"c":"وَلَعَلَّكُمْ","d":"walaʿallakum","e":"and that you may"},{"c":"تَشْكُرُونَ","d":"tashkurūna","e":"be grateful"}],"a":{"g":"And of His signs is that He sends the winds as bringers of good tidings and to let you taste His mercy and so the ships may sail at His command and so you may seek of His bounty, and perhaps you will be grateful."}},"47":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَقَدْ","d":"walaqad","e":"And verily"},{"c":"أَرْسَلْنَا","d":"arsalnā","e":"We sent"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"before you"},{"c":"قَبْلِكَ","d":"qablika","e":"before you"},{"c":"رُسُلًا","d":"rusulan","e":"Messengers"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"to"},{"c":"قَوْمِهِمْ","d":"qawmihim","e":"their people"},{"c":"فَجَاءُوهُمْ","d":"fajāūhum","e":"and they came to them"},{"c":"بِالْبَيِّنَاتِ","d":"bil-bayināti","e":"with clear proofs"},{"c":"فَانْتَقَمْنَا","d":"fa-intaqamnā","e":"then We took retribution"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"from"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"those who"},{"c":"أَجْرَمُوا","d":"ajramū","e":"committed crimes"},{"c":"وَكَانَ","d":"wakāna","e":"And it was"},{"c":"حَقًّا","d":"ḥaqqan","e":"incumbent"},{"c":"عَلَيْنَا","d":"ʿalaynā","e":"upon Us"},{"c":"نَصْرُ","d":"naṣru","e":"(to) help"},{"c":"الْمُؤْمِنِينَ","d":"l-mu'minīna","e":"the believers"}],"a":{"g":"And We have already sent messengers before you to their peoples, and they came to them with clear evidences; then We took retribution from those who committed crimes, and incumbent upon Us was support of the believers."}},"48":{"w":[{"c":"اللَّهُ","d":"al-lahu","e":"Allah"},{"c":"الَّذِي","d":"alladhī","e":"(is) the One Who"},{"c":"يُرْسِلُ","d":"yur'silu","e":"sends"},{"c":"الرِّيَاحَ","d":"l-riyāḥa","e":"the winds"},{"c":"فَتُثِيرُ","d":"fatuthīru","e":"so they raise"},{"c":"سَحَابًا","d":"saḥāban","e":"(the) clouds"},{"c":"فَيَبْسُطُهُ","d":"fayabsuṭuhu","e":"then He spreads them"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"السَّمَاءِ","d":"l-samāi","e":"the sky"},{"c":"كَيْفَ","d":"kayfa","e":"how"},{"c":"يَشَاءُ","d":"yashāu","e":"He wills"},{"c":"وَيَجْعَلُهُ","d":"wayajʿaluhu","e":"and He makes them"},{"c":"كِسَفًا","d":"kisafan","e":"fragments"},{"c":"فَتَرَى","d":"fatarā","e":"so you see"},{"c":"الْوَدْقَ","d":"l-wadqa","e":"the rain"},{"c":"يَخْرُجُ","d":"yakhruju","e":"coming forth"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"خِلَالِهِ","d":"khilālihi","e":"their midst"},{"c":"فَإِذَا","d":"fa-idhā","e":"Then when"},{"c":"أَصَابَ","d":"aṣāba","e":"He causes it to fall on"},{"c":"بِهِ","d":"bihi","e":"He causes it to fall on"},{"c":"مَنْ","d":"man","e":"whom"},{"c":"يَشَاءُ","d":"yashāu","e":"He wills"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"of"},{"c":"عِبَادِهِ","d":"ʿibādihi","e":"His slaves"},{"c":"إِذَا","d":"idhā","e":"behold"},{"c":"هُمْ","d":"hum","e":"They"},{"c":"يَسْتَبْشِرُونَ","d":"yastabshirūna","e":"rejoice"}],"a":{"g":"It is Allah who sends the winds, and they stir the clouds and spread them in the sky however He wills, and He makes them fragments so you see the rain emerge from within them. And when He causes it to fall upon whom He wills of His servants, immediately they rejoice"}},"49":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِنْ","d":"wa-in","e":"And certainly"},{"c":"كَانُوا","d":"kānū","e":"they were"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"before"},{"c":"قَبْلِ","d":"qabli","e":"before"},{"c":"أَنْ","d":"an","e":"[that]"},{"c":"يُنَزَّلَ","d":"yunazzala","e":"it was sent down"},{"c":"عَلَيْهِمْ","d":"ʿalayhim","e":"upon them"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"[before it]"},{"c":"قَبْلِهِ","d":"qablihi","e":"[before it]"},{"c":"لَمُبْلِسِينَ","d":"lamub'lisīna","e":"surely in despair"}],"a":{"g":"Although they were, before it was sent down upon them - before that, in despair."}},"50":{"w":[{"c":"فَانْظُرْ","d":"fa-unẓur","e":"So look"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"at"},{"c":"ءَاثَارِ","d":"āthāri","e":"(the) effects"},{"c":"رَحْمَتِ","d":"raḥmati","e":"(of the) Mercy"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"(of) Allah"},{"c":"كَيْفَ","d":"kayfa","e":"how"},{"c":"يُحْيِي","d":"yuḥ'yī","e":"He gives life"},{"c":"الْأَرْضَ","d":"l-arḍa","e":"(to) the earth"},{"c":"بَعْدَ","d":"baʿda","e":"after"},{"c":"مَوْتِهَا","d":"mawtihā","e":"its death"},{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"ذَلِكَ","d":"dhālika","e":"that"},{"c":"لَمُحْيِي","d":"lamuḥ'yī","e":"surely He (will) give life"},{"c":"الْمَوْتَى","d":"l-mawtā","e":"(to) the dead"},{"c":"وَهُوَ","d":"wahuwa","e":"And He"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"(is) on"},{"c":"كُلِّ","d":"kulli","e":"every"},{"c":"شَيْءٍ","d":"shayin","e":"thing"},{"c":"قَدِيرٌ","d":"qadīrun","e":"All-Powerful"}],"a":{"g":"So observe the effects of the mercy of Allah - how He gives life to the earth after its lifelessness. Indeed, that [same one] will give life to the dead, and He is over all things competent."}},"51":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَئِنْ","d":"wala-in","e":"But if"},{"c":"أَرْسَلْنَا","d":"arsalnā","e":"We sent"},{"c":"رِيحًا","d":"rīḥan","e":"a wind"},{"c":"فَرَأَوْهُ","d":"fara-awhu","e":"and they see it"},{"c":"مُصْفَرًّا","d":"muṣ'farran","e":"turn yellow"},{"c":"لَظَلُّوا","d":"laẓallū","e":"certainly they continue"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"after it"},{"c":"بَعْدِهِ","d":"baʿdihi","e":"after it"},{"c":"يَكْفُرُونَ","d":"yakfurūna","e":"(in) disbelief"}],"a":{"g":"But if We should send a [bad] wind and they saw [their crops] turned yellow, they would remain thereafter disbelievers."}},"52":{"w":[{"c":"فَإِنَّكَ","d":"fa-innaka","e":"So indeed, you"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"(can) not"},{"c":"تُسْمِعُ","d":"tus'miʿu","e":"make the dead hear"},{"c":"الْمَوْتَى","d":"l-mawtā","e":"make the dead hear"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"and not"},{"c":"تُسْمِعُ","d":"tus'miʿu","e":"make the deaf hear"},{"c":"الصُّمَّ","d":"l-ṣuma","e":"make the deaf hear"},{"c":"الدُّعَاءَ","d":"l-duʿāa","e":"the call"},{"c":"إِذَا","d":"idhā","e":"when"},{"c":"وَلَّوْا","d":"wallaw","e":"they turn"},{"c":"مُدْبِرِينَ","d":"mud'birīna","e":"retreating"}],"a":{"g":"So indeed, you will not make the dead hear, nor will you make the deaf hear the call when they turn their backs, retreating."}},"53":{"w":[{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"And not"},{"c":"أَنْتَ","d":"anta","e":"you"},{"c":"بِهَادِ","d":"bihādi","e":"can guide"},{"c":"الْعُمْيِ","d":"l-ʿum'yi","e":"the blind"},{"c":"عَنْ","d":"ʿan","e":"from"},{"c":"ضَلَالَتِهِمْ","d":"ḍalālatihim","e":"their error"},{"c":"إِنْ","d":"in","e":"Not"},{"c":"تُسْمِعُ","d":"tus'miʿu","e":"you can make hear"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"except"},{"c":"مَنْ","d":"man","e":"(those) who"},{"c":"يُؤْمِنُ","d":"yu'minu","e":"believe"},{"c":"بِءَايَاتِنَا","d":"biāyātinā","e":"in Our Verses"},{"c":"فَهُمْ","d":"fahum","e":"so they"},{"c":"مُسْلِمُونَ","d":"mus'limūna","e":"surrender"}],"a":{"g":"And you cannot guide the blind away from their error. You will only make hear those who believe in Our verses so they are Muslims [in submission to Allah]."}},"54":{"w":[{"c":"اللَّهُ","d":"al-lahu","e":"Allah"},{"c":"الَّذِي","d":"alladhī","e":"(is) the One Who"},{"c":"خَلَقَكُمْ","d":"khalaqakum","e":"created you"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"ضَعْفٍ","d":"ḍaʿfin","e":"weakness"},{"c":"ثُمَّ","d":"thumma","e":"then"},{"c":"جَعَلَ","d":"jaʿala","e":"made"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"after"},{"c":"بَعْدِ","d":"baʿdi","e":"after"},{"c":"ضَعْفٍ","d":"ḍaʿfin","e":"weakness"},{"c":"قُوَّةً","d":"quwwatan","e":"strength"},{"c":"ثُمَّ","d":"thumma","e":"then"},{"c":"جَعَلَ","d":"jaʿala","e":"made"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"after"},{"c":"بَعْدِ","d":"baʿdi","e":"after"},{"c":"قُوَّةٍ","d":"quwwatin","e":"strength"},{"c":"ضَعْفًا","d":"ḍaʿfan","e":"weakness"},{"c":"وَشَيْبَةً","d":"washaybatan","e":"and gray hair"},{"c":"يَخْلُقُ","d":"yakhluqu","e":"He creates"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"what"},{"c":"يَشَاءُ","d":"yashāu","e":"He wills"},{"c":"وَهُوَ","d":"wahuwa","e":"and He"},{"c":"الْعَلِيمُ","d":"l-ʿalīmu","e":"(is) the All-Knower"},{"c":"الْقَدِيرُ","d":"l-qadīru","e":"the All-Powerful"}],"a":{"g":"Allah is the one who created you from weakness, then made after weakness strength, then made after strength weakness and white hair. He creates what He wills, and He is the Knowing, the Competent."}},"55":{"w":[{"c":"وَيَوْمَ","d":"wayawma","e":"And (the) Day"},{"c":"تَقُومُ","d":"taqūmu","e":"will (be) established"},{"c":"السَّاعَةُ","d":"l-sāʿatu","e":"the Hour"},{"c":"يُقْسِمُ","d":"yuq'simu","e":"will swear"},{"c":"الْمُجْرِمُونَ","d":"l-muj'rimūna","e":"the criminals"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"not"},{"c":"لَبِثُوا","d":"labithū","e":"they remained"},{"c":"غَيْرَ","d":"ghayra","e":"but"},{"c":"سَاعَةٍ","d":"sāʿatin","e":"an hour"},{"c":"كَذَلِكَ","d":"kadhālika","e":"Thus"},{"c":"كَانُوا","d":"kānū","e":"they were"},{"c":"يُؤْفَكُونَ","d":"yu'fakūna","e":"deluded"}],"a":{"g":"And the Day the Hour appears the criminals will swear they had remained but an hour. Thus they were deluded."}},"56":{"w":[{"c":"وَقَالَ","d":"waqāla","e":"But will say"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"those who"},{"c":"أُوتُوا","d":"ūtū","e":"were given"},{"c":"الْعِلْمَ","d":"l-ʿil'ma","e":"the knowledge"},{"c":"وَالْإِيمَانَ","d":"wal-īmāna","e":"and the faith"},{"c":"لَقَدْ","d":"laqad","e":"Verily"},{"c":"لَبِثْتُمْ","d":"labith'tum","e":"you remained"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"by"},{"c":"كِتَابِ","d":"kitābi","e":"(the) Decree"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"(of) Allah"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"until"},{"c":"يَوْمِ","d":"yawmi","e":"(the) Day"},{"c":"الْبَعْثِ","d":"l-baʿthi","e":"(of) Resurrection"},{"c":"فَهَذَا","d":"fahādhā","e":"And this"},{"c":"يَوْمُ","d":"yawmu","e":"(is the) Day"},{"c":"الْبَعْثِ","d":"l-baʿthi","e":"(of) the Resurrection"},{"c":"وَلَكِنَّكُمْ","d":"walākinnakum","e":"but you"},{"c":"كُنْتُمْ","d":"kuntum","e":"were"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"not"},{"c":"تَعْلَمُونَ","d":"taʿlamūna","e":"knowing"}],"a":{"g":"But those who were given knowledge and faith will say, \"You remained the extent of Allah 's decree until the Day of Resurrection, and this is the Day of Resurrection, but you did not used to know.\""}},"57":{"w":[{"c":"فَيَوْمَئِذٍ","d":"fayawma-idhin","e":"So that Day"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"not"},{"c":"يَنْفَعُ","d":"yanfaʿu","e":"will profit"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"those who"},{"c":"ظَلَمُوا","d":"ẓalamū","e":"wronged"},{"c":"مَعْذِرَتُهُمْ","d":"maʿdhiratuhum","e":"their excuses"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"and not"},{"c":"هُمْ","d":"hum","e":"they"},{"c":"يُسْتَعْتَبُونَ","d":"yus'taʿtabūna","e":"will be allowed to make amends"}],"a":{"g":"So that Day, their excuse will not benefit those who wronged, nor will they be asked to appease [Allah]."}},"58":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَقَدْ","d":"walaqad","e":"And verily"},{"c":"ضَرَبْنَا","d":"ḍarabnā","e":"We (have) set forth"},{"c":"لِلنَّاسِ","d":"lilnnāsi","e":"for mankind"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"هَذَا","d":"hādhā","e":"this"},{"c":"الْقُرْءَانِ","d":"l-qur'āni","e":"[the] Quran"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"of"},{"c":"كُلِّ","d":"kulli","e":"every"},{"c":"مَثَلٍ","d":"mathalin","e":"example"},{"c":"وَلَئِنْ","d":"wala-in","e":"But if"},{"c":"جِئْتَهُمْ","d":"ji'tahum","e":"you bring them"},{"c":"بِءَايَةٍ","d":"biāyatin","e":"a sign"},{"c":"لَيَقُولَنَّ","d":"layaqūlanna","e":"surely will say"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"those who"},{"c":"كَفَرُوا","d":"kafarū","e":"disbelieve"},{"c":"إِنْ","d":"in","e":"Not"},{"c":"أَنْتُمْ","d":"antum","e":"you"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"(are) except"},{"c":"مُبْطِلُونَ","d":"mub'ṭilūna","e":"falsifiers"}],"a":{"g":"And We have certainly presented to the people in this Qur'an from every [kind of] example. But, [O Muhammad], if you should bring them a sign, the disbelievers will surely say, \"You [believers] are but falsifiers.\""}},"59":{"w":[{"c":"كَذَلِكَ","d":"kadhālika","e":"Thus"},{"c":"يَطْبَعُ","d":"yaṭbaʿu","e":"Allah seals"},{"c":"اللَّهُ","d":"l-lahu","e":"Allah seals"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"[on]"},{"c":"قُلُوبِ","d":"qulūbi","e":"(the) hearts"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"(of) those who"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"(do) not"},{"c":"يَعْلَمُونَ","d":"yaʿlamūna","e":"know"}],"a":{"g":"Thus does Allah seal the hearts of those who do not know."}},"60":{"w":[{"c":"فَاصْبِرْ","d":"fa-iṣ'bir","e":"So be patient"},{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"وَعْدَ","d":"waʿda","e":"(the) Promise"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"(of) Allah"},{"c":"حَقٌّ","d":"ḥaqqun","e":"(is) true"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"And (let) not"},{"c":"يَسْتَخِفَّنَّكَ","d":"yastakhiffannaka","e":"take you in light estimation"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"those who"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"(are) not"},{"c":"يُوقِنُونَ","d":"yūqinūna","e":"certain in faith"}],"a":{"g":"So be patient. Indeed, the promise of Allah is truth. And let them not disquiet you who are not certain [in faith]."}}}